# [[on]]
#: {{ux|jam|Weh yuh deh '''pon'''?|What are you '''on'''?}}

====Usage notes====
* Jamaican Creole uses {{m-self|jam|pon}} only for {{m|en|on}} as a preposition, so it does not use {{m-self|jam|pon}} for {{m|en|on}} as an adjective, adverb, verb or noun.

